# Anchored, unlike the three above: an unanchored pattern matches at every level, and
# src/cyclops/projects/ is a real package. Without the leading slash git silently ignores
# the whole thing, exactly as rsync did in deploy/push.sh.
/projects/
# Same argument, and the same anchor: what it knows about you is yours, not the repo's.
/about-you.md

